{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"AlfaMuffin","id":"176404876983664640","is_bot":0,"username":"alfamuffin"},"author_id":"176404876983664640","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Certainly, as much is only fair considering the work you did to get it out intact.\" \"If you need any help searching for other information in here,\" pointing to the library, \"feel free to search me out. I spend most my time reading in <#636015050829856768>. Two heads could certainly be more efficient in search.\"","created_at":"2020-07-21T18:09:53.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735196872456798230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"“I may just do that. Thank you for being understanding.” He puts the book in his pack. “I’ll bring this to you there tomorrow if I don’t see you around town.”","created_at":"2020-07-21T18:13:03.693000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735197669382815845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
